[{"answer":"Hello?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh hello. My name's Jan.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you the right person to talk to about the Buckworth Conservation Group?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'm Peter. I'm the secretary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Good. I've just moved to this area, and I'm interested in getting involved.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I was in a similar group where I used to live.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you tell me something about your activities, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we have a mixture of regular activities and special events.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/9.mp3"},{"answer":"One of the regular ones is trying to keep the beach free of litter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/10.mp3"},{"answer":"A few of us spend a couple of hours a month on it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's awful how much there is to clear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I wish people would be more responsible and take it home with them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I totally agree.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd be happy to help with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it OK to take dogs?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid not, as they're banned from the beach itself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/17.mp3"},{"answer":"You can take them along the cliffs, though. And children are welcome.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/19.mp3"},{"answer":"We also manage a nature reserve, and there's a lot to do there all year round.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/20.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, because it's a popular place to visit,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/21.mp3"},{"answer":"we spend a lot of time looking after the paths","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/22.mp3"},{"answer":"and making sure they're in good condition for walking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I could certainly help with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And we have a programme of creating new habitats there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/26.mp3"},{"answer":"We've just finished making and installing nesting boxes for birds to use,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/27.mp3"},{"answer":"and next we're going to work on encouraging insects,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/28.mp3"},{"answer":"they're important for the biodiversity of the reserve.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/29.mp3"},{"answer":"They certainly are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and we're also running a project to identify the different species of butterflies that visit the reserve.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/31.mp3"},{"answer":"You might be interested in taking part in that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I was involved in something similar where I used to live,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/34.mp3"},{"answer":"counting all the species of moths.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd enjoy that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Another job we're doing at the reserve is replacing the wall on the southern side,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/37.mp3"},{"answer":"between the parking area and our woodshed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/38.mp3"},{"answer":"It was badly damaged in a storm last month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/39.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Then as I said, we have a programme of events as well, both at the weekend, and during the week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I presume you have guided walks?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/43.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to get to know the local countryside, as I'm new to the area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we do. The next walk is to Ruston Island, a week on Saturday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/45.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll be meeting in the car park at Dunsmore Beach at low tide,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/46.mp3"},{"answer":"that's when the sands are dry enough for us to walk to the island without getting wet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/48.mp3"},{"answer":"The island's a great place to explore.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/49.mp3"},{"answer":"It's quite small, and it's got a range of habitats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/50.mp3"},{"answer":"It's also an ideal location for seeing seals just off the coast, or even on the beach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/51.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And is there anything we should bring, like a picnic, for instance?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, do bring one, as it's a full-day walk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/54.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course it'll be wet walking across and back,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/55.mp3"},{"answer":"so make sure your boots are waterproof.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I must buy a new pair, there's a hole in one of my current ones!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'd definitely like to come on the walk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Then later this month we're having a one-day woodwork session in Hopton Wood.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I've never tried that before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it OK for beginners to take part?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Definitely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/63.mp3"},{"answer":"There'll be a couple of experts leading the session,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/64.mp3"},{"answer":"and we keep the number of participants down, so you'll get as much help as you need.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Excellent!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/66.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd love to be able to make chairs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/67.mp3"},{"answer":"That's probably too ambitious for one day!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/68.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll be starting with wooden spoons,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/69.mp3"},{"answer":"and of course learning how to use the tools.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/70.mp3"},{"answer":"And anything you make is yours to take home with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/71.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds like fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/72.mp3"},{"answer":"When is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/73.mp3"},{"answer":"It's on the 17th, from 10 a.m. until 3.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/74.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a charge of £35, including lunch","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/75.mp3"},{"answer":"or £40 if you want to camp in the wood.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/76.mp3"},{"answer":"I should think I'll come home the same day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/77-2023-07-03-22-55-02.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'd certainly like to join the group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-1-section-1-2022-12-19-21-22-35/78.mp3"}]
